  "description": "Topological quantum computing plugin for FSharp.Azure.Quantum. Provides anyon theory (Ising/Fibonacci/SU(2)_k), braiding compilation, gate-to-braid conversion, Majorana hardware simulator, noise models, and topological file format (.tqp). Seamlessly integrates with main package algorithms (Grover, QFT, QAOA) via IQuantumBackend interface. Requires FSharp.Azure.Quantum v1.2.7+.",
